a séance at school, a teen girl minding her younger siblings at home suspects an evil force has entered their apartment.","tagline":"Someone answered your call."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Está inspirada en el único caso en la historia que la policía española clasifica como sobrenatural y queda sin resolver hasta la fecha.  Durante un eclipse total de sol, Verónica y dos amigas deciden hacer una ouija para invocar el espíritu de su padre. Después de romperse la ouija, Verónica entra en una especie de trance y se desmaya ante el pavor de sus amigos. Una vez recuperada, empieza a percibir cosas extrañas en su hogar que le hacen pensar que trajo a su padre de vuelta al mundo de los vivos.","tagline":"Alguien respondió a tu llamada."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xjpCl2zrYJjt5lz2RXJyjuP5rZm.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xjpCl2zrYJjt5lz2RXJyjuP5rZm.png","language":"en","width":1272,"height":166},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rLcAOAJLHrW9DCZHrWy72skM8Tf.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rLcAOAJLHrW9DCZHrWy72skM8Tf.png","language":"es","width":1272,"height":170}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xHP6mYLQKbJY9pg99PGoGKmmBZX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xHP6mYLQKbJY9pg99PGoGKmmBZX.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5Ajy8ZwsfyvkEpjfnWHcXZknfS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p5Ajy8ZwsfyvkEpjfnWHcXZknfS.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aUMpPCjI56B0et4tQle4JwfqhmG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aUMpPCjI56B0et4tQle4JwfqhmG.jpg","language":"en","width":1333,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wpBT3BYs3JZkN8pK951beb9cCOc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wpBT3BYs